{"id":2840,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p><br></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=SUlWzkozlDU8QfLl4L8nmGsLNU4nmUriU8W2oRC4UzfkUz90gihFp2hmCIa0UYyDnkyDokyiM4rkM4TRnmW7U8MRL4TfLzC8nmrRnznkMRfFLNV7U4T7M46FLNlsM4UJqjfjo4OeosWs_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PLmvsgtA8pUIcc&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=11277&e=.jpg\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/C6D68575B79CF2DCCC39A164F5CE4B40/2ADC9D77/2E774\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=SUlWzkozlDU8QfLl4L8nmGsLNU4nmUriU8W2oRC4UzfkUz90gihFp2hmCIa0UYyDnkyDokyiM4rkM4TRnmW7U8MRL4TfLzC8nmrRnznkMRfFLNV7U4T7M46FLNlsM4UJqjfjo4OeosWs_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PLmvsgtA8pUIcc&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=11277&e=.jpg\"></p><p>春风拂槛，芳华正好。为庆祝“三八”妇女节，致敬学院全体女教职工，传递人文温度，人文社会科学学院精心举办春暖三月，“花”生美好主题花艺沙龙活动。在馥郁花香与欢声笑语中，学院女教师以花为媒、以艺怡情，共赴一场春日浪漫之约，定格专属女神节的美好瞬间。&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=SU4vzYnRLZMmMkLlR9DL7LsolnfnN-rbMzTfoRM7n7lDLmN0gihFp2hmCIa0okhfLYyiLShfLmT2M8CDo7UZnmMRU87ZUzCZnRA2UmfkL7WFo7UYLz-PUmfFLN7PUz-Jqjfjo4OeosWs_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PLmvsgtA8pUIcc&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=11277&e=.jpg\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/8A351A29F7F68D8F3CCA8A68D8FB0B0B/8D2121B0/2A1A2\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=SU4vzYnRLZMmMkLlR9DL7LsolnfnN-rbMzTfoRM7n7lDLmN0gihFp2hmCIa0okhfLYyiLShfLmT2M8CDo7UZnmMRU87ZUzCZnRA2UmfkL7WFo7UYLz-PUmfFLN7PUz-Jqjfjo4OeosWs_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PLmvsgtA8pUIcc&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=11277&e=.jpg\"></p><p>活动现场暖意融融、繁花锦簇，各类鲜花错落陈列，搭配精致花器与丝带，营造出清新雅致的艺术氛围。特邀花艺老师悉心讲解花艺知识，示范修剪、搭配、造型等技巧，老师们静心聆听、动手创作。&nbsp;</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=SoR9z4nRrkU8WVMl4nRnRLanzNsLlVrfLRv4oRCYM4C8LzG0gihFp2hmCIa0okhfUSyPU1y4MmlPnz62L4LsL4rRnmvYM4WRL87anRGaLlrFL7CiMzfRn7QFL8CaUz7Jqjfjo4OeosWs_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PLmvsgtA8pUIcc&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=11277&e=.jpg\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/8AA1B3651E7F33735CF7272C3A0D001E/0F550CDF/3F0A1\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=SoR9z4nRrkU8WVMl4nRnRLanzNsLlVrfLRv4oRCYM4C8LzG0gihFp2hmCIa0okhfUSyPU1y4MmlPnz62L4LsL4rRnmvYM4WRL87anRGaLlrFL7CiMzfRn7QFL8CaUz7Jqjfjo4OeosWs_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PLmvsgtA8pUIcc&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=11277&e=.jpg\"></p><p>现场氛围温馨而热烈，老师们相互交流心得、分享创意，时而低头雕琢作品，时而举花相视一笑，将春日美好与心中期许融入花艺创作。一枝一叶总关情，一插一剪皆匠心，原本普通的花材，在巧思与巧手之下，化作一件件层次丰盈、格调雅致的花艺作品，尽显女性的细腻审美与创造活力。<br></p><p><br></p></div></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://shss.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=SUlWzkozlDU8QfLl4L8nmGsLNU4nmUriU8W2oRC4UzfkUz90gihFp2hmCIa0UYyDnkyDokyiM4rkM4TRnmW7U8MRL4TfLzC8nmrRnznkMRfFLNV7U4T7M46FLNlsM4UJqjfjo4OeosWs_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PLmvsgtA8pUIcc&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=11277&e=.jpg"}